Source code in <code>streamo/overlays.py</code> <pre><code>def title_opacity(elapsed: float, duration: float, fade: float) -&gt; float:
    if elapsed &gt;= duration:
        return 0.0
    if fade == 0:
        return 1.0
    return max(0.0, min(1.0, elapsed / fade, (duration - elapsed) / fade))
